flowchart LR
  accTitle: DOT-Design system context and supported runtime mappings
  accDescr: DOT authors combine capabilities, contracts, anchors, service bindings, configuration, and runtime declarations in dot.json. DOT-Schema and dotx validate the reusable definition, DOT-Registry publishes and resolves it, and a separate composition pins instances and wires. The dotx lifecycle layer deploys Docker images, Docker Compose, Kubernetes manifests, Helm charts, and Vagrantfiles. WebAssembly modules are represented by the domain model but require an external lifecycle adapter.

  subgraph DesignTime["1–2 · Reusable model, validation, discovery, and composition"]
    direction TB
    Authored["Author-owned DOT model<br/><br/>Skills · Contracts<br/>Anchors · service-port bindings<br/>Runtimes · deployments · services · configuration"]
    Dot[("dot.json<br/>portable source of truth")]
    Authored --> Dot

    Schema["DOT-Schema<br/>JSON Schema 2020-12"] -.->|constrains| Validation["dotx validate<br/>schema + domain relationships"]
    Registry["DOT-Registry<br/>publish · discover · resolve Anchors"]
    Document["Composition document<br/>pinned DOT instances · wires<br/>inputs · dependencies · exposures"]
    Compose["dotx compose<br/>validate · plan · apply<br/>status · destroy"]

    Dot -->|validated as one DOT| Validation
    Dot -->|published and versioned| Registry
    Dot -.->|identity and version pinned| Document
    Document --> Compose
    Validation -->|validated definition| Compose
    Registry -.->|optional discovery and resolution| Compose
  end

  subgraph Execution["3 · Selected deployment and runtime execution"]
    direction TB
    Adapters["dotx lifecycle adapters<br/>deploy · start · stop · status · destroy"]
    Docker["Docker platform<br/>Docker Image · Docker Compose<br/>docker · docker compose"]
    Kubernetes["Kubernetes platform<br/>Kubernetes Manifest · Helm Chart<br/>kubectl · helm"]
    Vagrant["Vagrant platform<br/>Vagrantfile<br/>vagrant · provider-managed VM"]
    Wasm["WebAssembly platform<br/>WASM Module<br/>external lifecycle adapter required"]
    Native["Platform-native resources<br/>workloads · services · endpoints · live state"]

    Adapters --> Docker
    Adapters --> Kubernetes
    Adapters --> Vagrant
    Adapters -.->|model support; external adapter| Wasm
    Docker --> Native
    Kubernetes --> Native
    Vagrant --> Native
    Wasm -.-> Native
  end

  DesignTime -->|selects a compatible deployment| Execution

